@RateLimiting_HostAddress = https://localhost:7116

### Named global fixed window (only applies to this action)
GET {{RateLimiting_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/Global
Accept: application/json

### Token bucket
GET {{RateLimiting_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/Burst
Accept: application/json

### Concurrency: send overlapping requests; each request takes two seconds
GET {{RateLimiting_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/Expensive
Accept: application/json

### Fixed window
GET {{RateLimiting_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/Strict
Accept: application/json

### Sliding window
GET {{RateLimiting_HostAddress}}/api/Dashboard/Sliding
Accept: application/json

# All rejected requests return HTTP 429 with application/problem+json.
# Body fields: type, title, status, detail, policy, limiterType, retryAfterSeconds, traceId.
# Retry-After is included when the limiter can estimate it (not concurrency).
# The global policy is per user/IP; other policies share capacity across callers.
# Each action uses only its own policy. Actions without a policy are not limited.
